## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Probability | Mitigation |
|------|-------------|------------|
| Users don't respond to outcome emails | 40% | Make it 1-click (emoji rating); offer extended free trial for feedback |
| Not enough data for V3 matching | 35% | Keep V2 as fallback; V3 activates per-channel when n>10 outcomes |
| Growth stalls at <$200 MRR | 30% | This is normal for Month 2. Focus on quality, not growth |
